---
description: Shared UI package conventions (named exports, CSS modules)
globs: libs/ui-components/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

# ui-components

- **Named exports** for components (`export function Button`) — do not default-export new components
- Styles: colocated `Component.module.css` + `import styles from './Component.module.css'`
- Classnames via `cx` from `classnames`
- Export public types next to the component (`export type ButtonProps`)
- Treat the package as a design-system surface: avoid app-specific Redux/router imports
- Keep a11y basics (button types, tooltip labeling) consistent with siblings
